  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x6A15">
    <title>8115 C_CONF_CAT_EFF</title>
    <description>Catalyst efficiency monitoring configuration (C_CONF_CAT_EFF). 1 = enabled, 0 = disabled.&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;When 1 (and a lambda bank is configured) the code sets the downstream O2 sensor flag, which starts the downstream lambda sensor heater PWM outputs and the catalyst monitoring. Set to 0 to disable the downstream O2 sensors/heaters (frees their heater output pins).&#013;&#010;&#013;&#010;Located by code analysis (the routine that sets the flag reads this byte); same relative position as 0x010F on the SIMK41 and 0x0114 on ca655019/ca655022. Next to C_CONF_LAM at 0x811E.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="13" />
    <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedaddress="0x8115" mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
    <decimalpl>0</decimalpl>
    <datatype>1</datatype>
    <unittype>0</unittype>
    <DALINK index="0" />
    <MATH equation="X">
      <VAR id="X" />
    </MATH>
  </XDFCONSTANT>
